          ['Stomatocytes', 'Uniconcave disc with an elongated, curved, mouth-like or slit-like central pallor', 'Membrane cation permeability defect (increased intracellular Na/water) or thick smear drying artifact', 'Hereditary chondrodysplasia-dwarfism in Alaskan Malamutes, Drentse Patrijshond, hepatic disease, lead poisoning']
